     1329   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF RS-sts IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1330   DO:
     1331     ASSIGN
     1332     rs-sts
     1333     p-sts = (IF rs-sts = 'все':U THEN ? ELSE INTEGER(rs-sts))
     1334     .
